        <p style="color: var(--text-color); margin: 5px 0;">No k3s install, no registry container, no OPNsense change, and no database replication work occurs until this plan is approved. All remote-execution steps require explicit go-ahead; credentials are handled by the user, not automated scripts.</p>
    </div>

