    <p style="color: var(--text-muted-color); font-size: var(--font-size-small);"><strong>Doc currency:</strong> this plan is kept current as phases complete. Each phase todo in project <a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=202" style="color: var(--link-color);">#202 (INFRA-HA)</a> carries its gate; when a phase lands, its todo is closed and the section here is marked done with commit evidence. Last reviewed: 2026-08-10 &mdash; Phase A decomposed into todos 2037&ndash;2044, A.0 resolved, registry port corrected to 5001, &sect;8 blast radius corrected. v1.12 adds &sect;3h (what k8s load balancing does and does not do), &sect;3i (stickiness), &sect;6a (Store::Dummy blocker, todo #2046 on AUTH-EVO) and &sect;6b (cross-request /tmp state, todo #2047).</p>
